# Sycamore website — local development env vars
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values. `.env.local` is gitignored.
# In Vercel, the same vars live in Project Settings → Environment Variables.

# Cloudflare Turnstile (Phase 1A D5 contact form)
# - SITE key is public (embedded in the widget); safe to commit values to public repos.
# - SECRET key is server-only; NEVER expose, NEVER commit a real value.
# The values below are placeholders. The real SITE key is safe to paste in
# Ryan's Vercel env-var UI; the SECRET key is in cowork-exchange/outbox/website-phase-1a-secrets.md
# (read-only on terminator67) — paste into Vercel env vars only.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
